Subject: [PATCH] Exclude the new Prophide helper from legacy charger-property reads

The API30 compatibility grant enumerates old excluded domains. A new domain
would otherwise inherit charger_status_prop reads forbidden by One UI 9. Keep
every existing reader unchanged and subtract ONLY prophide_stage. Do not
change the donor neverallow or the legacy type mapping.

diff --git a/plat_pub_versioned.cil b/plat_pub_versioned.cil
--- a/plat_pub_versioned.cil
+++ b/plat_pub_versioned.cil
@@ -6411,7 +6411,9 @@
 (allow domain exported_radio_prop_30_0 (file (read getattr map open)))
 (allow domain exported_secure_prop_30_0 (file (read getattr map open)))
 ; One UI 9 contract: restrict legacy grant
-(allow unica_api30_public_grant_41 exported_system_prop_30_0 (file (read open)))
+(typeattribute unica_prophide_api30_property_reader)
+(typeattributeset unica_prophide_api30_property_reader (and unica_api30_public_grant_41 (not (prophide_stage))))
+(allow unica_prophide_api30_property_reader exported_system_prop_30_0 (file (read open)))
 (allow unica_api30_public_grant_42 unica_api30_public_grant_43 (file (read open)))
 (allow domain exported_system_prop_30_0 (file (getattr map)))
 (allow domain exported_vold_prop_30_0 (file (read getattr map open)))
